            "<strong>Simple Social Buttons<\/strong> by <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/wpbrigade.com\/?utm_source=simple-social-buttons-lite&utm_medium=link-header&utm_campaign=pro-upgrade\">WPBrigade<\/a><\/strong> adds an advanced set of social media sharing buttons to your WordPress sites, such as: <strong>Facebook<\/strong>, <strong>Twitter\/X<\/strong>, <strong>LinkedIn<\/strong>, <strong>WhatsApp<\/strong>, <strong>Viber<\/strong>, <strong>Reddit<\/strong> and <strong>Pinterest<\/strong>. This makes it the most flexible social sharing plugin for everyone.": [
                "<strong>Simple Social Buttons<\/strong> af <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/wpbrigade.com\/?utm_source=simple-social-buttons-lite&utm_medium=link-header&utm_campaign=pro-upgrade\">WPBrigade<\/a><\/strong> tilf\u00f8jer et avanceret s\u00e6t af sociale mediedelingsknapper til dine WordPress-sider, s\u00e5som: <strong>Facebook<\/strong>, <strong>Twitter\/X<\/strong>, <strong>LinkedIn<\/strong>, <strong>WhatsApp<\/strong>, <strong>Viber<\/strong>, <strong>Reddit<\/strong> og <strong>Pinterest<\/strong>. Dette g\u00f8r det til det mest fleksible sociale delingsplugin for alle."
            ],
