            "Internal share click counts are recorded for supported networks (for example Twitter\/X, LinkedIn, WhatsApp) when visitors use the sharing buttons on your site. Counts are stored locally and are not sent to those social networks. Clear your page cache after upgrading the plugin so button markup stays in sync.": [
                "Interne delingsklik t\u00e6llinger registreres for underst\u00f8ttede netv\u00e6rk (for eksempel Twitter\/X, LinkedIn, WhatsApp), n\u00e5r bes\u00f8gende bruger delingsknapperne p\u00e5 dit site. T\u00e6llinger gemmes lokalt og sendes ikke til de sociale netv\u00e6rk. Ryd din sidecache efter opgradering af plugin'et, s\u00e5 knapmarkup forbliver synkroniseret."
            ],
