            ],
            "Keep Open Graph tags enabled so Snapchat can show your page title and preview.": [
                "Hold Open Graph tags aktiveret, s\u00e5 Snapchat kan vise din side titel og forh\u00e5ndsvisning."
            ],
            "Official Buttons": [
                "Officielle knapper"
            ],
            "Choose a button style that fits your site's look and feel.": [
                "V\u00e6lg en knap stil, der passer til dit sites udseende og f\u00f8lelse."
            ],
            "Dismiss this notice.": [
                "Afvis denne meddelelse."
            ],
            "Dismiss": [
                "Afvis"
            ],
            "Share on LinkedIn": [
                "Del p\u00e5 LinkedIn"
            ],
            "Simple Social Buttons Pro lets you set custom background, hover, and icon colors for every button, so they blend naturally with your website's design instead of standing out like a default plugin. Buttons that fit your site tend to get clicked more, which means more shares and more traffic for you. Pro also adds features like buttons on images, popups on exit intent, fly in slide animations, and more.": [
                "Simple Social Buttons Pro giver dig mulighed for at indstille brugerdefinerede baggrunds-, hover- og ikonfarver for hver knap, s\u00e5 de naturligt blander sig med dit websites design i stedet for at skille sig ud som en standard plugin. Knapper, der passer til dit site, bliver typisk trykket mere p\u00e5, hvilket betyder flere delinger og mere trafik til dig. Pro tilf\u00f8jer ogs\u00e5 funktioner som knapper p\u00e5 billeder, popups ved exit-intent, fly-in glideanimationer og mere."
            ],
            "Simple Social Buttons Pro lets you display share buttons directly on images and photos across your posts and pages, choose their position, add icon spacing, and set custom colors that match your site. You can also hide them on mobile and control exactly which post types they appear on. It's an easy way to turn every image into a shareable opportunity and drive more traffic.": [
                "Simple Social Buttons Pro giver dig mulighed for at vise delingsknapper direkte p\u00e5 billeder og fotos p\u00e5 tv\u00e6rs af dine indl\u00e6g og sider, v\u00e6lge deres position, tilf\u00f8je ikonafstand og indstille brugerdefinerede farver, der matcher dit site. Du kan ogs\u00e5 skjule dem p\u00e5 mobil og kontrollere pr\u00e6cis, hvilke indl\u00e6gstyper de vises p\u00e5. Det er en nem m\u00e5de at g\u00f8re hvert billede til en delbar mulighed og drive mere trafik."
            ],
            "Simple Social Buttons Pro lets you create a custom share popup with your own title and message, and trigger it exactly when it matters, like before visitors leave or after they scroll. You can add animation, display share counts or total shares to build social proof, and set custom colors to match your brand. It's a smart way to catch visitor attention right when they're most likely to share.": [
                "Simple Social Buttons Pro giver dig mulighed for at oprette en brugerdefineret delings-popup med din egen titel og besked og udl\u00f8se den pr\u00e6cist, n\u00e5r det er vigtigt, som f\u00f8r bes\u00f8gende forlader eller efter de ruller. Du kan tilf\u00f8je animation, vise delingsantal eller samlede delinger for at opbygge socialt bevis, og indstille brugerdefinerede farver, der matcher dit brand. Det er en smart m\u00e5de at fange bes\u00f8gendes opm\u00e6rksomhed lige n\u00e5r de er mest tilb\u00f8jelige til at dele."
            ],
            "Simple Social Buttons Pro lets you create a custom Fly In box with your own title and message, choose its position and animation, and even display share counts or total shares to build social proof. You can fine-tune timing, icon spacing, and colors to match your brand, and control which post types it appears on. It's a great way to prompt visitors to share right when they're most engaged.": [
                "Simple Social Buttons Pro giver dig mulighed for at oprette en brugerdefineret Fly In boks med din egen titel og besked, v\u00e6lge dens position og animation, og endda vise delingsantal eller samlede delinger for at opbygge socialt bevis. Du kan finjustere timing, ikonafstand og farver for at matche dit brand, og kontrollere hvilke indl\u00e6gstyper den vises p\u00e5. Det er en fantastisk m\u00e5de at opfordre bes\u00f8gende til at dele lige n\u00e5r de er mest engagerede."
            ],
